        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Knocking Sweep"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe Jackal Guard swings their weapon with a sweeping spin. They attempt separate Athletics checks to Trip any number of creatures within their reach. Each attempt counts toward the Jackal Guard's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after they make all the attacks."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "e86437b4-2a72-4379-adda-389d279d58fa",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:13.992409"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Spear Vault"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Frequency: 1/round\n\nThe Jackal Guard uses their spear to jump over or around a creature and create an opening. The Jackal Guard Strides up to half their Speed. This movement doesn't trigger reactions. During this movement, they can move through the space of one creature, and when the Jackal Guard moves through a creature's space in this way, that creature becomes flatfooted until the end of the Jackal Guard's turn. If the Jackal Guard ends their movement within melee reach of at least one enemy, they can make a melee Strike against that enemy."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
